@startuml TEntity
title TEntity — State Machine (6 states)

hide empty description

[*] --> Start

Start --> Scanning : doStart()

Scanning --> Scanning : [backlog empty]\n/ schedule(now + PLAN_INTERVAL)
Scanning --> Loading  : [backlog non-empty]\n/ buildAndValidateItinerary()\n/ initLegState(0)\n/ schedule(leg[0].src.transferSrtTime)

Loading --> Loading  : [pickupCounter < 0, at T_start]\n/ validateItinerary() assert\n/ assertSerialsAtNode(src)\n/ record(Transport+Serials, start, load)\n/ pickupCounter=0, schedule(staggered[0])

Loading --> Loading  : [0 ≤ pickupCounter < N]\n/ executePickup(sn[i]): onBoard+=sn[i]\n/ notifyPickUp → SEntity.receivePickUp\n/ schedule(staggered[i+1] or T_end)

Loading --> Moving   : [pickupCounter == N, at T_end]\n/ assertSerialsOnTransport(name)\n/ record(Serials+Transport, finish, load)\n/ notifyAllDeparture → SEntity.notifyDeparture\n/ schedule(leg.dst.transferSrtTime)

Moving --> Unloading : (at T3 = leg.dst.transferSrtTime)\n/ arriveAtDst(): setLoc(dstNode)\n/ notifyAllArrival → SEntity.notifyArrival\n/ dropoffCounter = -1\n/ schedule(T3) [same time → triggers doUnloading]

Unloading --> Unloading : [dropoffCounter < 0, at T3]\n/ assertSerialsOnTransport(name)\n/ record(Transport+Serials, start, unload)\n/ dropoffCounter=0, schedule(staggered[0])

Unloading --> Unloading : [0 ≤ dropoffCounter < N]\n/ executeDropoff(sn[i]): onBoard-=sn[i]\n/ notifyDropOff → SEntity.receiveDO\n/ schedule(staggered[i+1] or T_end)

Unloading --> Loading  : [dropoffCounter == N, more legs remain]\n/ assertSerialsAtNode(dst)\n/ record(Serials+Transport, finish, unload)\n/ initLegState(legIdx+1)\n/ schedule(next leg src.transferSrtTime)

Unloading --> Scanning : [dropoffCounter == N, no legs remain]\n/ assertSerialsAtNode(dst)\n/ record(Serials+Transport, finish, unload)\n/ schedule(now + PLAN_INTERVAL)

note right of Loading
  Staggered pickup timing:
    staggeredTime(i) =
      T_start + (i+1)·(T_end−T_start) / (N+2)
  N = items in leg.src.transfer
  T_start = src.transferSrtTime

  Itinerary re-validated (validP) at
  start of EVERY leg's Loading phase.
  PLAN_INTERVAL = 4.0 h
end note

note right of Unloading
  Staggered dropoff timing:
    staggeredTime(i) =
      T_start + (i+1)·(T_end−T_start) / (N+2)
  N = items in leg.dst.transfer
  T_start = dst.transferSrtTime

  onBoard carries across legs;
  reset to empty only at legIdx=0.
end note

note right of Moving
  No DES events fire during transit
  [T_end .. T3].
  TEntity is scheduled only at T3.
end note

@enduml
